# Gore variant of map_classroom_td: a covered body in the aisle, a drag trail
# from the teacher's desk, splatter, footprints leaving for the door.
# GORE SET (optional): part of the gore option; see docs/decisions.md D9.
# Top-down mock-up: a classroom at night. Chalkboard, TV showing static,
# clock at 4:44 and a window on the wall face; rows of desks; the sobok
# ghost stands in the aisle.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 224
@output ../mockups/map_classroom_gore_td.png
@preview ../previews/map_classroom_gore_td_x2.png 2
@fill D

@tiles td tiles_topdown.pix
@tiles tw tiles_topdown_walltop.pix
@tiles ns tiles_night_school.pix
@tiles cl tiles_classroom.pix
@tiles rr tiles_restroom.pix
@tiles pr tiles_props.pix
@legend A tw:walltop_15
@legend B td:face_upper
@legend C td:face_lower
@legend D tw:walltop_13
@legend E td:floor_wood_shadow
@legend F tw:walltop_07
@legend G td:floor_wood
@legend H td:floor_wood_b
@legend I tw:walltop_14
@legend J ns:window_0_0
@legend K ns:window_1_0
